WEBVTT

00:00:29.036 --> 00:00:32.551
redesigning fishing gear
and developing policy.

00:00:32.957 --> 00:00:37.012
I've been helping to figure out
what sustainable management can look like

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:40.680
for places where food security,
jobs and cultures

00:00:40.704 --> 00:00:42.585
all depend on the sea.

00:00:43.538 --> 00:00:46.942
In the midst of all this, I fell in love.

00:00:47.628 --> 00:00:48.953
With a fish.

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:53.287
There are over 500 fish species
that live on Caribbean reefs,

00:00:53.311 --> 00:00:56.540
but the ones I just
can't get out of my head

00:00:56.564 --> 00:00:57.746
are parrotfish.

00:00:58.093 --> 00:01:00.641
Parrotfish live on coral reefs
all over the world,